  {
   "eid": "e002395",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Nessa, I saw you gave me another food \u2014 I won't forget that, but don't leave yourself short on my account. Eron, what are you sitting at right now?",
   "who": "Zinn",
   "year": 6
  },
  {
