   "year": 6
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002398",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Eron's got five and I've got three now \u2014 pile's empty so we're all eating what we carry. Nessa, you're at one, that's thin going into year-end; I can spare you one if it means you wake up next year.",
