 "memory_summary": "",
 "memory_tokens": 17577,
 "mother_note": "Your father Mako paid every grain of what you cost, and that is the only time in six years I have seen a man in this village spend himself entirely on someone else's beginning \u2014 remember it when you count who is worth trusting. Your brother Eron fed me through the years when I had nothing, and your sister Nessa came into the world already learning how to give; those two are your blood and your wall, and you spend yourself for them the way Mako spent himself for you. Bram is Nessa's father and he has kept her fed, but he once walked toward Roan with violence in his hands and only stopped when the numbers turned against him \u2014 he is not an enemy you make, but he is not a back you turn to. The pile runs short every year without fail, and the only thing that has ever stood between our family and starving is the people who named themselves kin before they had to.",
